<h2 id="h-welcome-to-rattler-nation" class="wp-block-heading">Welcome to Rattler Nation</h2>



<p class="has-large-font-size wp-block-paragraph">At Otero College, we strive to provide our students with a top-quality education that prepares them for success in their future careers. Our experienced and dedicated faculty are committed to ensuring that each student receives individual attention and personalized support to achieve their academic goals.</p>



<div class="wp-block-group has-background" style="background-color:#0c234b"><div class="wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained">
<div id="wp-block-themeisle-blocks-font-awesome-icons-c22a1f27" class="wp-block-themeisle-blocks-font-awesome-icons"><span class="wp-block-themeisle-blocks-font-awesome-icons-container nan-padding"><i class="fas fa-map-marked-alt"></i></span></div>



