<div class="has-light-bg is-style-boxed wp-block-themeisle-blocks-posts-grid" id="wp-block-themeisle-blocks-posts-grid-5fa95b2f"><div class="is-list"><div class="o-posts-grid-post-blog o-posts-grid-post-plain"><div class="o-posts-grid-post"><div class="o-posts-grid-post-image"><a href="https://otero.edu/welding-program-expands-doubling-capacity/"><img decoding="async" width="800" height="600" src="https://otero.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Newsroom.png" class="attachment-full size-full" alt="A welder with the otero college logo above them" srcset="https://otero.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Newsroom.png 800w, https://otero.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Newsroom-640x480.png 640w, https://otero.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Newsroom-768x576.png 768w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" /></a></div><div class="o-posts-grid-post-body"><span class="o-posts-grid-post-category"><a href="https://otero.edu/category/rattler-nation-newsroom/">Rattler Nation Newsroom</a></span><h3 class="o-posts-grid-post-title"><a href="https://otero.edu/welding-program-expands-doubling-capacity/">Welding Program Expands, Doubling Capacity</a></h3><div class="o-posts-grid-post-description"><p>Following a variety of renovations and upgrades to Otero College&#8217;s Welding Program facilities,…</p><a class="o-posts-read-more" href="https://otero.edu/welding-program-expands-doubling-capacity/">Read More</a></div></div></div></div><div class="o-posts-grid-post-blog o-posts-grid-post-plain"><div class="o-posts-grid-post"><div class="o-posts-grid-post-image"><a href="https://otero.edu/otero-college-offers-essential-entrepreneurship-certificate-courses/"><img decoding="async" width="800" height="600" src="https://otero.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Untitled-Design.png" class="attachment-full size-full" alt="Otero College logo above a business woman who is working from home." srcset="https://otero.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Untitled-Design.png 800w, https://otero.edu/wp-content/uploads/2